                                            <li><a href="https://www.bdcb.gov.bn/docs/regulatory/takaful-insurance/BDCB-Fit-and-Proper-Checklist-for-Agents.pdf" class="link-gold" target="_blank">Fit and Proper Checklist</a> for shareholder(s), director(s), principal officer and corporate nominee(s).</li>
                                        </ol>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <p>All completed applications, including necessary documentations, with the application fees should be submitted to:</p>
