                    </div>
                    <p>The <a href="https://bilif.com.bn/" class="link-gold !font-normal" target="_blank">Brunei Institute of Leadership & Islamic Finance (BILIF)</a> holds classes for interested applicants wishing to sit for the Qualifying Examination for Insurance and Takaful Agent (QEFITA).</p>
                    <p>Interested applicants can contact BILIF at <a href="tel:+6732461221" class="link-gold !font-normal">+6732461221</a>/<a href="tel:+6732461223" class="link-gold !font-normal">2461223</a> or <a href="mailto:inquiry@bilif.com.bn" class="link-gold !font-normal">inquiry@bilif.com.bn</a>.</p>
                </section>
